        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mont_Vernon%2C_New_Hampshire"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1853 the Appleton Academy opened, later becoming the McCollom Institute, a private school that closed just before 1900.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mont_Vernon%2C_New_Hampshire"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The original Town Hall, built in 1781 by locals frustrated with Amherst’s Congregational Church, now houses the historical society museum.",
